ES2024 §21.4.1: Date calendar/time-of-day getters (getMilliseconds,
getSeconds, getMinutes, getHours, getDay, getDate, getMonth)
implemented via integer modular arithmetic and the Howard Hinnant
civil_from_days algorithm. Verifies known timestamps including
the Unix epoch, a January 1, a mid-year time, and a leap day.
